import{_ as a,o as t,c as r,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 812 | Transcended Ones and Laws | The Hyper-Multiverse Scale of Law-Anchor Authority","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 812 | Transcended Ones and Laws | The Hyper-Multiverse Scale of Law-Anchor Authority","no":812,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Laws","Law-Anchor Authority","Hyper-Multiverse","Scale"],"related":["20-Anchor Structure and Levels","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0812_模块4-超脱者与法则-法则锚定权限超多元尺度.md","filePath":"en/0812_模块4-超脱者与法则-法则锚定权限超多元尺度.md"}'),i={name:"en/0812_模块4-超脱者与法则-法则锚定权限超多元尺度.md"};function o(s,e,l,c,h,d){return t(),r("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-812-transcended-ones-and-laws-the-hyper-multiverse-scale-of-law-anchor-authority" tabindex="-1">Entry 812 | Transcended Ones and Laws | The Hyper-Multiverse Scale of Law-Anchor Authority <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-812-transcended-ones-and-laws-the-hyper-multiverse-scale-of-law-anchor-authority" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 812 | Transcended Ones and Laws | The Hyper-Multiverse Scale of Law-Anchor Authority&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 20, 28, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-one-planet-to-the-multiverse-—-law-anchoring-s-scale-leap" tabindex="-1">Introduction: from one planet to the multiverse — law anchoring&#39;s scale leap <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-one-planet-to-the-multiverse-—-law-anchoring-s-scale-leap" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: from one planet to the multiverse — law anchoring&#39;s scale leap&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-anchor authority is not only a matter of &quot;size,&quot; but also of &quot;scale.&quot; A cultivator calibrating law parameters on a planetary anchor and a transcended one fine-tuning the hyper-multiverse law network on a cosmic origin anchor operate on entirely different magnitudes in object operated, complexity faced, and risk borne. This article specifically discusses this <strong>scale problem</strong>: when law-anchor authority leaps from the planetary scale to the hyper-multiverse scale, what does the transcended one face, and where is his authority boundary.</p><p>Six top-level axioms run through this entry: the anti-predation axiom requires the larger the scale the less it may be privatized — the hyper-multiverse-scale law network belongs to all Myriad Ranks; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires hyper-multiverse-scale law operations be known to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires the scale leap serve the cosmos&#39; overall uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires hyper-multiverse-scale law operations follow the strictest reporting approval; the law-first axiom ensures law self-consistency during the scale leap is not broken.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-five-scale-layers-of-law-anchoring-operation" tabindex="-1">I. Five Scale Layers of Law-Anchoring Operation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-scale-layers-of-law-anchoring-operation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five Scale Layers of Law-Anchoring Operation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-anchoring operation by spatial scale divides into five layers; each layer&#39;s operation content and risk level differ:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Scale Layer</th><th>Operation Space</th><th>Typical Operation</th><th>Risk Level</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Planetary scale</td><td>Single planet&#39;s surface and near-earth</td><td>Planetary law-parameter calibration, local law-connection maintenance</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td>Galaxy scale</td><td>Single galaxy range</td><td>Galaxy law-network connection, galaxy-grade law-drift correction</td><td>Low-mid</td></tr><tr><td>Star-sector scale</td><td>Cross-galaxy range</td><td>Star-sector law-parameter fine-tuning, star-sector law-consistency calibration</td><td>Mid</td></tr><tr><td>Plane scale</td><td>Single plane&#39;s whole domain</td><td>Plane law-network maintenance, plane-law compatibility adjustment</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>Hyper-multiverse scale</td><td>Cross-plane, cross-cosmic-structure</td><td>Hyper-multiverse law-network trunk calibration, new-cosmic-structure law weaving</td><td>Extreme</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The first four scales may be operated by plane-sovereign strong ones (Origin Realm); the fifth scale — hyper-multiverse scale — may only be participated in by transcended ones entering the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm. This is not because the hyper-multiverse scale needs stronger &quot;power,&quot; but because it needs higher <strong>system understanding</strong>: the transcended one must simultaneously understand multiple planes&#39; law differences, cross-plane law-compatibility patterns, and the overall architecture of cosmic-structure laws.</p><h2 id="ii-hyper-multiverse-scale-operation-s-three-special-challenges" tabindex="-1">II. Hyper-Multiverse-Scale Operation&#39;s Three Special Challenges <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-hyper-multiverse-scale-operation-s-three-special-challenges" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Hyper-Multiverse-Scale Operation&#39;s Three Special Challenges&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Hyper-multiverse-scale law anchoring has three special challenges over the first four scales:</p><ol><li><strong>Cross-plane law compatibility</strong>: different planes&#39; law parameters naturally differ (Document 28 already demonstrates that plane barriers consist of law differences). When the transcended one operates the law network at hyper-multiverse scale, he may not forcibly unify each plane&#39;s law parameters — that would destroy each plane&#39;s law uniqueness. His work is <strong>building compatibility channels amid differences</strong>, letting planes of different law systems interconnect while keeping their own law character.</li><li><strong>Causal threads&#39; cross-plane extension</strong>: adjusting one law parameter at planetary scale has limited causal impact range. But at hyper-multiverse scale, a law fine-tuning&#39;s causal impact may span multiple planes — the transcended one must anticipate this cross-plane causal thread&#39;s trend and follow the causal self-discipline axiom for the strictest reporting.</li><li><strong>Multi-cosmic-structure parallel maintenance</strong>: Heng Yuan Zhou is not a single cosmos, but a multiverse structure. When the transcended one operates at hyper-multiverse scale, he must simultaneously maintain law-network consistency across multiple cosmic structures — may not attend to one and neglect the other.</li></ol><p>Three challenges&#39; common point: <strong>the larger the scale, the less operations may be &quot;taken for granted,&quot; the more systematic, prudent, and fully argued engineering-style operations are needed.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-hyper-multiverse-scale-operation-s-authority-boundary" tabindex="-1">III. Hyper-Multiverse-Scale Operation&#39;s Authority Boundary <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-hyper-multiverse-scale-operation-s-authority-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Hyper-Multiverse-Scale Operation&#39;s Authority Boundary&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one has law-anchor authority at hyper-multiverse scale, but this authority has clear boundaries. What he may and may not do:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>May Do</th><th>May Not Do</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Calibrate hyper-multiverse law-network parameter drift</td><td>Modify the cosmos&#39; fundamental laws (such as energy conservation)</td></tr><tr><td>Weave cross-plane law-compatibility channels</td><td>Abolish any plane&#39;s unique law system</td></tr><tr><td>Lay law skeletons in new cosmic structures</td><td>Force-unify one plane&#39;s law parameters to other planes</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor the hyper-multiverse law network&#39;s global health</td><td>Use law operations for personal gain</td></tr><tr><td>Initiate law-revision proposals (follow democratic procedure)</td><td>Privately modify laws without Myriad-Rank approval</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This boundary&#39;s core logic: <strong>the hyper-multiverse-scale law network is Myriad Ranks&#39; common infrastructure; the transcended one is the maintainer, not the owner.</strong> He may repair, adjust, expand, but may not change the fundamentals, may not dismantle others&#39;, may not use it privately.</p><h2 id="iv-hyper-multiverse-scale-operation-s-approval-procedure" tabindex="-1">IV. Hyper-Multiverse-Scale Operation&#39;s Approval Procedure <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-hyper-multiverse-scale-operation-s-approval-procedure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Hyper-Multiverse-Scale Operation&#39;s Approval Procedure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Because hyper-multiverse-scale law operations carry extremely high risk, the approval procedure is also strictest:</p><ol><li><strong>Proposal stage</strong>: the transcended one submits an operation proposal, including operation objective, technical scheme, projected impact scope, risk assessment;</li><li><strong>Quest Domain simulation review</strong>: the proposal undergoes full-dimensional deduction in the Quest Sediment Domain — deducing operation impact under different scenarios, identifying potential risks;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank Republican Council review</strong>: Myriad-Rank representatives review the proposal, focusing on whether it is compatible with Myriad-Rank interests, whether hidden predatory risk exists;</li><li><strong>Pilot operation</strong>: after review passes, first pilot in a small range, verifying operation effects match the simulation deduction;</li><li><strong>Full promotion</strong>: after the pilot passes, the operation formally implements, monitored throughout by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision.</li></ol><p>Five-step approval ensures: hyper-multiverse-scale law operation is not one transcended one&#39;s personal will, but the result of Myriad Ranks&#39; common decision.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: hyper-multiverse-scale operation&#39;s pre-operation simulation review avoids energy waste from &quot;taken-for-granted operations causing large-area law-network failure&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the authority-boundary table seals at the law level the channel of the transcended one using hyper-multiverse authority for private gain</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system, strong ones after leveling up directly &quot;control multiverse laws,&quot; no boundary no approval; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one at hyper-multiverse scale follows five-step approval for every operation</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: hyper-multiverse-scale law-compatibility channels open to all Myriad-Rank planes and all races, not excluding any plane from the multiverse law network</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: five scale layers, three special challenges, authority boundary, and approval procedure are all publicly queryable; Myriad Ranks may supervise the legitimacy of hyper-multiverse law operations</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-anchor authority&#39;s hyper-multiverse scale is the transcended one&#39;s grandest, most delicate, and most constrained working surface. The operation space he may touch spans planes and cosmic structures, but the bottom line he may not touch is equally clear: do not modify fundamental laws, do not destroy plane character, do not pursue private gain, do not bypass Myriad-Rank approval. The larger the scale, the stricter the boundary; the stronger the ability, the more elaborate the procedure. This is law-anchor authority&#39;s orthodox positioning at the hyper-multiverse realm: <strong>you may touch the most things, but you may not touch what should not be touched.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">Entry 20 · Anchor Structure and Levels</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/28-跨位面锚点连接.html">Entry 28 · Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/811_模块4-超脱者与法则-总论.html">Entry 811 · Transcended Ones and Laws Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const y=a(i,[["render",o]]);export{u as __pageData,y as default};
